Package: BayesBadger
Title: Bayesian double generalized beta regression with spatial and temporal borrowing.
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Abhi Jain", email = "abhijainstats@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package includes code to run the Bayesian double generalized
    beta regression model with spatial and temporal borrowing. The package also
    includes functions to compute marginal effects for mean model covariates
    and marginal effects for the spatial effects.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
